# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Getting Ahead" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Talking to Gordon
1	line	Player	Hello. Who are you?
1	line	Gordon	The name's Gordon. Good day to you.
1	line	Player	It's a nice farm you've got here.
1	line	Gordon	Thank you. We built it ourselves.
1	line	Player	Really? So you haven't been here long?
1	line	Gordon	Nope. Not too long ago you couldn't safely travel around these parts. Too many lizardmen. But then some Hosidius explorers discovered how fertile this land was.
1	line	Gordon	Lord Hosidius made a deal with Lord Shayzien and the lizardmen were cleared out to make room for the Farming Guild.
1	line	Gordon	When we heard, we decided to come up here and start up our own farm.
1	option	Need a hand with anything?
2	line	Player	Need a hand with anything?
2	cond	If the player does not have the requirements to start the quest:
3	line	Gordon	I think we're good. Thank you for the offer though.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has the requirements to start the quest:
3	line	Gordon	Well actually, there is something we've been having a problem with.
3	line	Gordon	Recently, some strange beast has been stealing our livestock at night. The soldiers are too busy dealing with the lizardmen to help, so we haven't been able to stop it.
3	line	Gordon	You look like you know your way around a weapon. If you can kill the beast and bring me its head as proof, I'll ensure you are compensated for your trouble.
3	select	Start the Getting Ahead quest?
3	option	Yes.
4	line	Player	Bring back the head? I can do that. I'm good at killing things. Do you know where the beast is?
4	line	Gordon	Well it can't be living too far from here, but I don't know exactly where. You might want to check with my wife, Mary. Perhaps she's seen something I haven't.
4	line	Player	Very well. I'll return once I have the head of this beast!
3	option	No.
4	line	Player	Not something I can help with I'm afraid. Good luck though.
4	line	Gordon	I understand. I'm sure someone else will be able to help.
4	action	end
1	option	Very nice. Well I hope it goes well for you.
2	line	Player	Very nice. Well I hope it goes well for you.
2	line	Gordon	Thank you friend. See you later.
2	action	end
