0	section	Talking to Gordon after killing the Headless Beast
1	line	Gordon	Hello again. Any luck finding that beast?
1	line	Player	The beast is dead!
1	line	Gordon	Wonderful! Do you have the head?
1	line	Player	Well that's the thing...
1	line	Gordon	Is there a problem?
1	line	Player	So it didn't actually have a head.
1	line	Gordon	Didn't have a head?
1	line	Player	Nope.
1	line	Gordon	Like... at all?
1	line	Player	Not even a proper stump.
1	line	Gordon	Oh...
1	line	Player	Sorry.
1	line	Player	...
1	line	Player	Can I get paid now?
1	line	Gordon	I'm sorry, but no. I agreed to pay you for a head and you don't have one.
1	line	Player	Well actually I do have a head. Quite a good looking one in fact. It was the beast that didn't.
1	line	Gordon	That's not what I meant. Look, it's nothing personal, but I can't be seen paying someone if they didn't do the job.
1	line	Player	But I did the job... How am I meant to bring you the head of a beast with no head?
1	line	Gordon	Maybe you killed the wrong beast? It doesn't make sense that a headless beast would be taking cattle. How would it eat them?
1	line	Player	I don't know...
1	line	Gordon	Well if you manage to get hold of the beast's head, let me know. Until then, I can't pay you.
1	line	Player	Okay...
1	action	end
