1	line	Player	No...
1	line	Gordon	Well I can't pay you if you don't have the head.
1	line	Player	Okay...
1	action	end
0	section	Neilan's journal
1	box	You show the journal to Gordon.
1	line	Player	I don't have the head of the beast. I do have proof it was headless though.
1	line	Gordon	Proof? This doesn't seem like proof to me. Anyone could have written this. Maybe you wrote it?
1	line	Player	You assume I can read and write.
1	line	Gordon	Can you?
1	line	Player	Well.. yes. I promise I didn't write this though.
1	line	Gordon	Well you would say that. I'm sorry but I'm not having this. Come back when you have the head of the beast.
1	action	end
