1	line	Gordon	Hmmm... I'm not so sure...
1	line	Player	This is literally the head of a dead bear. What is wrong with you?
1	line	Gordon	I can see this is the head of a bear! This beast we're dealing with is more than a mere bear though!
1	line	Player	What? You said you'd never seen the beast! How do you know it wasn't just a bear?
1	line	Gordon	We've dealt with bears before! This is clearly something more! Now, go and find the real beast!
