0	section	Talking to Mary after killing the beast
1	line	Mary	Hello there. How goes the headhunt?
1	line	Player	I've run into a little issue. The beast is dead, but it didn't have a head. Your husband says he won't pay me until I bring him one.
1	line	Mary	Oh dear. I'm afraid Gordon can be quite picky sometimes.
1	line	Player	But what do I do now? I can't bring him a head if there isn't one.
1	line	Mary	Well, between you and me, Gordon is a good farmer but I wouldn't say he's a genius by any means. He also doesn't actually know what the beast looks like.
1	line	Player	So I make him a fake head! Great idea!
1	line	Mary	That's the spirit! I've tried my hand at clay modelling in the past. You can make all sorts of things. Just get some soft clay and a knife and I'm sure you'll be able to make a lovely head.
1	line	Player	I'll give it a shot!
1	action	end
