1	line	Gordon	Yes, I think this is the head of a beast.
1	line	Player	Wonderful! So about my payment?
1	line	Gordon	Well hang on just a moment...
1	line	Player	Uh oh.
1	line	Gordon	Where's the blood? If this is a fresh kill, the head should have blood on.
1	line	Player	Ah... Yes... Well the thing about this head is that this is the head of a...
1	line	Gordon	Yes?
1	line	Player	A... bloodbear?
1	line	Gordon	Bloodbear? What's a bloodbear?
